# Optimization of LMS Moodle configuration and Education Technologies on the Example of Electrical Engineering Education

**Authors:** G. Slavko, S. Serhiienko

## Abstract
The analysis of the typical configuration of LMS Moodle is performed. The classification of plugins and system processes according to the criterion of competitive load on the system is given on the basis of statistical data collected on the example of training courses of electrotechnical specialties of KrNU. Based on the experience of LMS Moodle implementing, recommendations are given to administrators, lecturers and department heads to optimize the load on the Moodle system. It is investigated that such recommendations allow to reduce the peak load of the system by 15-20% in average.

